  "description": {
    "text": "The EX Trainer Kit, released in June 2004 in English, French, German and Italian only, taught the game with two half decks, Latias and Latios, together with a starter and an intermediate rule book, an EX Series booster pack, damage and status counters, a coin and a playmat. The cards carry the kit's own set symbol and number and no rarity mark. All are reprints from EX Ruby & Sapphire, EX Sandstorm and EX Dragon except the holo Latias and Latios, until then Japanese promotional cards.\n\nThis set holds the Latios half deck."
  },
